        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish and Decorate Rooms</h2>Create unique rooms that meet every guest's expectations. Choose from a wide range of furniture, decorations, and styles - from modern to classic and themed. Your creativity will determine the hotel's unique character and high guest ratings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Mini Guest Shop</h2>Expand your services by creating a shop with snacks, souvenirs, and everyday items. Manage inventory, set prices, and maintain order so guests feel comfortable and eager to take advantage of additional offers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanliness and Comfort at the Highest Level</h2>Regular cleaning of rooms and common areas is key to guest satisfaction. Maintain cleanliness and stock up on essential supplies to make guests feel at home – this is the foundation of good reviews and repeat bookings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hotel Expansion and Prestige</h2>Invest in improvements and expand your hotel by adding new rooms, attractive amenities like a spa or gym, and unique features. Increase your reputation and revenue by creating the perfect place for your dream vacation.",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish and Decorate Rooms</h2>Create unique rooms that meet every guest's expectations. Choose from a wide range of furniture, decorations, and styles - from modern to classic and themed. Your creativity will determine the hotel's unique character and high guest ratings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Mini Guest Shop</h2>Expand your services by creating a shop with snacks, souvenirs, and everyday items. Manage inventory, set prices, and maintain order so guests feel comfortable and eager to take advantage of additional offers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanliness and Comfort at the Highest Level</h2>Regular cleaning of rooms and common areas is key to guest satisfaction. Maintain cleanliness and stock up on essential supplies to make guests feel at home – this is the foundation of good reviews and repeat bookings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hotel Expansion and Prestige</h2>Invest in improvements and expand your hotel by adding new rooms, attractive amenities like a spa or gym, and unique features. Increase your reputation and revenue by creating the perfect place for your dream vacation.",
        "short_description": "Build and manage your own hotel, from a small property to a luxury resort. Design rooms, maintain cleanliness, develop amenities, and offer guests unforgettable experiences at your hotel!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Arabic, Dutch, Ukrainian, Slovenian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
